{kaṅkālamālinītantram}


oṃ namaḥ śrīgurave


śrībhairavī uvāca


tripureśa maheśāna pārvatīprāṇavallabha |

jagadvandya śūlapāṇe varṇānāṃ kāraṇaṃ vada || 1 ||


śrībhairava uvāca


kathayāmi varārohe varṇānāṃ bhedamuttamam |

na prakāśyaṃ mahādevi (!) tava snehāt subhāṣiṇi || 2 ||

yajjñātvā yogino yānti nirguṇatvaṃ mama priye (!)

tacchṛṇuśva svarūpeṇa mahāyauvanagarvite || 3 ||

śabdabrahmasvarūpaṃ tad ādikṣāntaṃ jagatprabhuḥ |

vidyudjihvā karālāsyā garjinī dhūmrabhairavī || 4 ||

kālarātrirvidārī ca mahāraudrī bhayaṃkarī |

saṃhāriṇī karālinī ūrdhvakeśyugrabhairavī || 5 ||

bhīmākṣī ḍākinī rudraḍākinī caṇḍiketi ca |

ete varṇāṇ svarā jñeyāḥ kaulini vyaṃjanān śṛṇu || 6 ||

krodhīśo vāmanaścaṇḍo vikāryunmattabhairavaḥ |

jvālāmukho raktadaṃṣṭro hasitāṅgo vaḍavāmukhaḥ || 7 ||

vidyunmukho mahājvālaḥ kapālī bhīṣaṇo ruruḥ |

saṃhārī bhairavo daṇḍī valibhugugraśūladhṛk || 8 ||

siṃhanādī kapardī ca karālāgnirbhayaṅkaraḥ |

bahurūpī mahākālo jīvātmā kṣatajokṣitaḥ || 9 ||

balabhedī raktapaśca caṇḍīśo jvalanadhvajaḥ |

vṛṣadhvajo vyomavaktrastrailokyagrasanātmakaḥ || 10 ||

ete ca vyañjanā jñeyāḥ kādikṣāntāḥ kramāditāḥ |

akārādikṣakārāntā varṇāstu śivaśaktayaḥ || 11 ||

pañcāśacca ime varṇā brahmarūpāḥ sanātanāḥ |

yeṣāṃ jñānaṃ vinā vāme siddhirna syād gurustani || 12 ||

te varṇasāgarāḥ proktā guṇatrayamayāḥ śubhe |

vidyudjihvā mukhaṃ kṛtvā caṇḍikāntaṃ nagātmaje || 13 ||

sattvaguṇamayā varṇā rajoguṇamayān śṛṇu |

krodhīśād daṇḍiparyantā vyañjanā rājasāḥ smṛtāḥ || 14 ||

balibhugvarṇamārabhya trailokyagrasanāvadhi |

jñeyāstamaḥsvarūpāste tebhyo jātān śṛṇu priye || 15 ||

guśabdaścāndhakāraḥ syād ruśabdastannirodhakṛt |

andhakāranirodhitvād gururityabhidhīyate || 16 ||

gakāraḥ siddhidaḥ prokto rakāraḥ pāpahārakaḥ |

ukārastu bhaved viṣṇustritayātmā guruḥ svayam || 17 ||

ādāvasau jāyate ca śabdabrahmasanātanaḥ |

vasujihvā kālarātryā rudraḍākinyalaṅkṛtā || 18 ||

viṣabījaṃ śrutimukhaṃ dhruvaṃ hālāhalaṃ priye |

oṃ caṇḍīśaḥ kṣatajārūḍho dhūmrabhairavyalaṅkṛtaḥ || 19 ||

nādabindusamāyuktaṃ lakṣmībījaṃ prakīrtitam |

śrīṃ | krodhīśaṃ kṣatajārūḍhaṃ dhūmrabhairavyalaṅkṛtam || 20 ||

nādabinduyutaṃ devi nāmabījaṃ prakīrtitam |

dhrīṃ (krodhīśovalabhṛd)(valibhug) dhūmrabhairavīnādabindubhiḥ || 21 ||

trimūrtirmanmathaḥ kāmabījaṃ trailokyamohanam |

krī(/) | kṣatajastho vyomavaktro thūmrabhairavyalaṅkṛtaḥ || 22 ||

nādabindusuśobhāḍhya māyālajjāhvayaṃ smṛtam |

krīṃ | vyomāsyañja vidārīsthaṃ nādabinduvirājitam || 23 ||

kūrcakālaṃ krodhabījaṃ jānīhi vīravandite |

hū(/) | vyomāsyaḥ kālarātryāḍhyo varmabid bindusaṃyutaḥ || 24 ||

kathitaṃ vacanaṃ bījaṃ kulācārapriye'male |

dū(/) | vyomāsyaṃ kṣatajārūḍhaṃ ḍākinyā nādabindubhiḥ || 25 ||

jyotirmantraṃ samākhyātaṃ mahāpātakanāśanam |

drā(/) | nādabindusamāyuktāṃ samādāyograbhairavīm || 26 ||

bhautikaṃ vāgbhavaṃ bījaṃ viddhi sārasvataṃ priye |

aiṃ pralayāgnirmahājālaḥ khyāto'stramanuḥ śive || 27 ||

raktakrodhīśabhīmākhyo'ṅkuśo'yaṃ nādabindumān |

krau(/) | dviṭhaḥ śivo vahni jāyā svāhā jvalanavallabhā || 28 ||

svāhāsvāhāsaṃyutaṃ dhūmrabhairavyā raktasya balibhojanam |

nādabindusamāyuktaṃ kiṅkiṇībījamuttamam || 29 ||

drī(/) | nādabindusamāyuktaṃ raktasthaṃ balibhojanam |

karālāsyāsanopetaṃ viśikākhyaṃ mahāmanum || 30 ||

dū(/) | vidāryā nekṣito guhye valibhuk kṣatajokṣitaḥ |

nādabindusamāyukto vijñeyaḥ piśitāśanaḥ || 31 ||

dhūmojjvalakarālāgni ūrdhvakeśīndubindubhiḥ |

yugāntakārakaṃ bījaṃ vīrapatniprakāśitam || 32 ||

saṃhāriṇyā sthitañcordhvaṃ kaśinantu kapardinam |

nādabindusamāyuktaṃ bījaṃ baitālikaṃ smṛtam || 33 ||

sanādabindukrodhīśaṃ guhye saṃhāriṇīsthitam |

kampinībījamityuktaṃ caṇḍikākhyaṃ manoharam || 34 ||

kapardinaṃ samādāya kṣatajokṣitasaṃsthitam |

saṃyuktaṃ dhūmrabhairavyā dhvāṅkṣo'yaṃ nādabindumān || 35 ||

prīṃ | kadalīdvayamādāya mahākālena maṇḍitam |

sanādastu namityuktaṃ caṇḍikākhyaṃ payodharam || 36 ||

ṭha(/) ṭha(/) | pralayāgnisthito dhūmadhvajo guhyeśabindumān |

saṃyukto dhūmrabhairavyā smṛtā phetkāriṇī priye || 37 ||

sphīṃ | kṣatajasthaṃ vyomavaktraṃ bindukhaṇḍendvalaṅkṛtam |

khadyotamiti vikhyātaṃ grasinīkālarātriyuk || 38 ||

drū(/) | kṣatajokṣitamārūḍhaṃ nādabindusamanvitam |

vidārībhūṣitaṃ devi bījaṃ vaivasvatātmakam || 39 ||

|| [iti dakṣiṇāmnāye sārghalakṣagranthe kaṅkālamālinītantre 
prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 1 ||

[atha dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ]


śrīpārvatī uvāca


deva deva mahādeva nīlakaṇṭha tapodhana |

yonimudrāṃ mahādeva tattvatrayaṃ parātparam |

etadeva mahādeva kathyatāṃ me pinākadhṛk || 1 ||


śrī(-)īśvara uvāca


śṛṇu vakṣyāmi deveśi dāso'haṃ tava suvrate |

atiguhyaṃ mahāpuṇyaṃ tattvatrayaṃ varānane || 2 ||

sārāt sāraṃ paraṃ guhyamatigopyaṃ suniścitam |

śaṅkāpi jāyate devi kathaṃ tatkathayāmyaham || 3 ||

kathayāmi maheśāni ājñayā tava bhāmini |

na cet tat kathyate devi tava krodhaḥ prajāyate || 4 ||

tvayā krodhe kṛte devi hāniḥ syānmama kāmini |

mantrārthaṃ mantracaitanyaṃ dharmārthakāmadaṃ priye || 5 ||

yonimudrā maheśāni tṛtīyaṃ brahmarūpiṇī |

ajñātvā yo japenmantraṃ nahi siddhiḥ prajāyate || 6 ||

jñātvā prārabhya kurvīta hyakurvāṇo vinaśyati |

yonimudrā maheśāni sākṣānmokṣaprasādhinī || 7 ||

tato yonirmaheśāni priyā mama yathā priye |

satataṃ parameśāni dāso'haṃ tava yoninā || 8 ||

tava yoniprasādena mṛtyuṃ jitvā varānane |

mṛtyujjayo'haṃ deveśi satataṃ kamalānane || 9 ||

tava yonau maheśāni brahmāṇḍaṃ sacarācaram |

tiṣṭhanti satataṃ devi brahmādyāstridivaukasaḥ || 10 ||

mayūrasya maheśāni pucche kṛtvā ca adbhutam |

yonyākāraṃ maheśāni dṛṣṭvā kṛṣṇaḥ śucismite || 11 ||

śire dhṛtvā varārohe trailokyaṃ vaśamānayet |

tava yoniṃ maheśāni bhāvayāmītyaharnniśam || 12 ||

tatraiva dṛṣṭvā brahmāṇḍaṃ nānyaṃ paśyāmi kāmini |

karpūrapulakodbhūtaṃ tava yonipuraṃ param || 13 ||

tava yonirmaheśāni tattvatrayasupūjitam |

retorajaḥsamāyuktaṃ sākṣānmanmathamandiram || 14 ||

na jāne kiṃ kṛtaṃ karma kālike kamalekṣaṇe |

tava yonau mahādevi ata eva varānane || 15 ||

yonimudrāṃ yonibījaṃ satataṃ parameśvari |

ahaṃ mṛtyujjayo devi yonimudrāprasādataḥ || 16 ||

yonibījaṃ maheśāni nigadāmi śṛṇu priye |

prathame parameśāni yoginīṃ rudrayoginīm || 17 ||

utkṛtya vahuyatnena balabījayutaṃ kuru |

vindvardhacandrasaṃyuktaṃ bījaṃ trailokyamohanam || 18 ||

baddhvā tu yonimudrāṃ vai pūrvoktakramataḥ priye |

yonibījaṃ maheśāni aṣṭottaraśataṃ japet || 19 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā yat phalaṃ labhate priye |

māhātmyaṃ tasya deveśi vaktuṃ ko vā kṣamo bhavet || 20 ||

yaḥ karoti prasannātmā rahasye yonirūpiṇīm |

brahmāṇḍaṃ pūjayet te na brahmādyāstridivaukasaḥ || 21 ||

tava yonirmaheśāni paraṃ brahmasvarūpiṇī |

tava yonirmaheśāni bhavasya mohinī priye || 22 ||

tava yonirmaheśāni siddhisūtreṇa veṣṭayet |

siddhisūtraṃ maheśāni triprakāraṃ varānane || 23 ||

īḍā ca piṅgalā caiva suṣumnātritayaṃ tathā |

sadānandamayīṃ yoniṃ nānāsukhavilāsinīm || 24 ||

śṛṅgārasamaye devi nāntaṃ gacchāmi pārvati |

mama liṅgo maheśāni bhinatti sakalaṃ jagat || 25 ||

tathāpi parameśāni nāntaṃ gacchāmi kāmini |

tava yonirmaheśāni na jāne kīdṛśīṃ gatim || 26 ||

tava yonirmaheśāni  ādyā prakṛtirūpiṇī |

sadā kuṇḍalinīṃ yonimahākuṇḍalinīṃ parām || 27 ||

yaḥ sadā parameśāni yoniṃ dṛṣṭvā varānane |

japed bījaṃ varārohe bhagāravyaṃ bhagarūpiṇīm || 28 ||

yoniṃ baddhvā maheśāni bhagabījena pārvati |

aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā mama tulyo bhavet priye || 29 ||

tava yonau maheśāni ramaṇaṃ yatnataścaret |

tasyā ramaṇamātreṇa brahmaviṣṇuśivātmakaḥ |

sa eva dhanavān vāgmī vāgīśasamatāṃ vrajet || 30 ||


śrīdevī uvāca


nīlakaṇṭha mahādeva rahasyaṃ kṛpayā vada |

yadi no kathyate deva vimuñcāmi tadā tanum || 31 ||


śrī īśvara uvāca


śṛṇu pārvati kṛṣṇāṅgi khajjanākṣi sulocane |

gopanīyaṃ rahasyaṃ hi sarvakāmaphalapradam || 32 ||

tisraḥ koṭyastadardhena śarīre nāḍikā matāḥ |

tāsu madhye daśa proktāstāsu tisro vyavasthitāḥ || 33 ||

pradhānā merudaṇḍāgre candrasūryāgnirūpiṇī |

majjayitvā suṣumnāyāmahaṃ yogī sureśvari || 34 ||

ṣaṭcakre parameśāni bhāvayed yonirūpiṇīm |

prathamaṃ parameśāni ādhārayugapatrakam || 35 ||

vādisāntyaiścaturvarṇairdrutahemasamaprabham |

taḍitkoṭiprabhākāraṃ sthānaṃ paramadurlabham || 36 ||

tat karṇikāyāṃ deveśi trikoṇamatisundaram |

icchājñānakriyārūpaṃ brahmaviṣṇuśivātmakam || 37 ||

madhye svayaṃ bhūliṅgaṃ ca kuṇḍalīveṣṭitaṃ sadā |

trikoṇākhyaṃ tu deveśi lakāraṃ cintayet tathā || 38 ||

brahmāṇḍaṃ tatra saṃcintya kāmadevaṃ ca cintayet |

bījaṃ tatraiva niścintyaṃ  yonāvādānameva ca || 39 ||

pade ca gamanaṃ pāyau visargaṃ nasi kāmini |

ghrāṇaṃ saṃcintya deveśi maheśi prāṇavallabhe || 40 ||

ḍākinīṃ paramārādhyāṃ śaktiṃ ca bhāvayet tataḥ |

etāni girije mātaḥ pṛthvīṃ nītvā gaṇeśvari || 41 ||

tanmadhye liṅgarūpaṃ hi kuṇḍalīveṣṭitaṃ priye |

tatra kuṇḍalinīṃ nityāṃ paramānandarūṣiṇīm || 42 ||

tatra dhyānaṃ prakurvīta siddhikāmo varānane |

koṭicandraprabhākārāṃ paraṃbrahmasvarūpiṇīm || 43 ||

caturbhujāṃ trinetrāñca varābhayakarāṃ tathā |

tathā ca pustakaṃ vīṇāṃ dhāriṇīṃ siṃhavāhinīm || 44 ||

gacchanti svāsanaṃ bhīmāṃ nānārūpadharāṃ parām |

pūrvoktāṃ pṛthvīṃ dhanyāṃ gandhe nītvā maheśvari || 45 ||

ākṛṣya praṇavenaiva jīvātmānaṃ nagendraje |

kuṇḍalinyā saha preme gandhamādāya sādhakaḥ || 46 ||

so'hamiti manunā devi svādhiṣṭhāne praveśayet |

tatpadmaṃ liṅgamūlasthaṃ sindūrābhaṃ ca ṣaḍdalam || 47 ||

sphuradvikramasaṃkāśairvādināntaiḥ suśobhitam |

tatkarṇikāyāṃ varuṇaṃ tatrāpi bhāvayeddharim || 48 ||

yuvatiṃ rākiṇīṃ śaktiṃ cintayitvā varānane |

rasanendriyayūpasthaṃ jalañca kāmalālase || 49 ||

etāni gandhañca śive rase nītvā vinodinīṃ |

jīvātmānaṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ rasañca maṇipūrake || 50 ||

nītvā paramayogena tatpadmaṃ digdalaṃ priye |

nīlavarṇaṃ taḍidrūpaṃ ḍādiphāntaiśca maṇḍitam || 51 ||

tatkarṇikāyāṃ suśroṇi vahniṃ sañcintya sādhakaḥ |

tatra rudraḥ svayaṃ kartā saṃhāre sakalasya ca || 52 ||

lākinīśaktisaṃyukto bhāvayet taṃ manohare |

tatra cakṣurindriyañca kṛtvā tejomayaṃ yajet || 53 ||

etaṃ rasañca subhage rūpaṃ nītvā mahābhāge |

jīvātmānaṃ kuṇḍalinīrūpañcānāhate nayet || 54 ||

bandhūkapuṣpasaṃkāśaṃ tatpadmaṃ dvādaśārakam |

kādiṭhāntaiḥ sphuradvarṇaiḥ śobhitāṃ haravallabhām || 55 ||

tatkarṇikāyāṃ vāyuñca jīvasthānanivāsinam |

tatra yonermaṇḍalañca bāṇaliṅgavirājitam || 56 ||

kākinīśaktisaṃyuktaṃ tatra vāyostvagindriyam |

etad rūpañca saṃyojya svarge ramaṇakāmini || 57 ||

jīvakuṇḍalinīṃ sparśaṃ viśuddhau sthāpayet tataḥ |

dhūmravarṇaṃ kaṇṭhapadmaṃ ṣoḍaśasvaramaṇḍitam || 58 ||

tatkarṇikāyāmākāśaṃ śivañca kāriṇīyutam |

vācaṃ śrotraṃ ca ākāśe saṃsthāpya naganandini || 59 ||

etāni sparśaṃ śabde ca nītvā śāṅkari matpriye |

jīrva kuṇḍalinīṃ śabdañcājñāpatre nidhāpayet || 60 ||

netrapadmaṃ śuklavarṇaṃ dvidalamakṣabhūṣitam |

tatkarṇikāyāṃ trikoṇaṃ yad bāṇaliṅgañca saṅgatam || 61 ||

manaścātra sadā bhāti hākinīśaktilāñchitam |

buddhiprakṛtyahaṅkāralakṣitaṃ tejasā param || 62 ||

jīvātmānaṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ manaścāpi maheśvari |

sahasrāre mahāpadme manaścāpi niyojayet || 63 ||

sahasrāraṃ nityapadmaṃ śuklavarṇamadhomukham |

akārādikṣakārāntaiḥ sphuradvarṇairvirājitam || 64 ||

tatkarṇikāyāṃ deveśi antarātmā tato guruḥ |

sūryasya maṇḍalañcaiva candramaṇḍalameva ca || 65 ||

tato vāyurmahānādo brahmarandhraṃ tataḥ smṛtam |

tasmin randhre visargañca nityānandaṃ nirañjatam || 66 ||

tadūrdhve śaṃkhinī devī sṛṣṭisthityantakāriṇī |

tasyādhaḥsthā ca deveśi caturmaṇḍalamadhyagam || 67 ||

trikoṇaṃ tatra saṃñcintya kailāsamatra bhāvayet |

iha sthāne mahādevi sthiracittaṃ vidhāya ca || 68 ||

jīvajīvī gatavyādhirna punarjanmasaṃbhavaḥ |

atra nityoditā vṛddhikṣayahīnā amākalā || 69 ||

tanmadhye kuṭilā nirvāṇākhyā saptadaśī kalā |

nirvāṇākhyāntargatā vahnirūpā nirodhikā || 70 ||

nādo'vyaktastaduṣari koṭyādityasamaprabhā |

nirvāṇaśaktiḥ paramā sarveṣāṃ yonirūpiṇī || 71 ||

asyāṃ śaktau śivaṃ jñeyaṃ nirvikāraṃ nirañjanam |

atraiva kuṇḍalīśakti rmudrākārā sureśvari || 72 ||

punastena prakāreṇa gacchantyādhārapaṅkaje |

kathitā yonimudreyaṃ mayā te parameśvari || 73 ||

vinā yena na siddhena niharet paramātmanā |

tad divyāmṛtadhārābhirlākṣābhābhirmaheśvari || 74 ||

tarpayed devatāṃ yogī yogenā'nena sādhakaḥ |

kuṇḍalīśaktisiddhiḥ syād varṇakoṭiśatairapi || 75 ||

tasmāt ttvayāpi girije gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |

mantrarūpāṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ dhyātvā ṣaṭcakramaṇḍale || 76 ||

kandamadhyāt sumadhuraṃ kūjantīṃ satatotthitām |

gacchantīṃ brahmarandhreṇa praviśantīṃ svaketanam || 77 ||

mūlādhāre ca tāṃ devīṃ saṃsthāpya vīravandite |

citriṇīgrathitā mālājāpaṃ brahmāṇḍasundari || 78 ||

rahasyaṃ paramaṃ divyaṃ mantracaitanyamīritam |

mudrācaitanyayorjñānaṃ varṇānāṃ jñānameva ca || 79 ||

mantrārthaṃ kathitaṃ devi tava snehāt priyaṃvade |

asya jñānaṃ vinā bhadre siddhirna syāt sulocane |

iti te kathitaṃ devi yonikrīḍedamuttamam || 80 ||


śrī(-)īśvara uvāca


surāsurajagadvandya pārvatībhagasevaka |

idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi yoneḥ kavacamuttamam || 81 ||


śrī(-)īśvara uvāca


yad dhṛtvā paṭhanāt sarvāḥ śaktayo varadāḥ priye |

etasya kavacasyāpi ṛṣiśca śrīsadāśivaḥ || 82 ||

chando gāyatrī devatā yonirūpā sanātanī |

caturvargeṣu deveśi viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 83 ||

