oṃ mām oṃ ākuṭām mama rakṣantu svāhā mam mām |

oṃ mam mām mim mīm mum mūm mem maim mom maum maṃmaḥ mama hṛdayādidakṣabāhuṃ rakṣantu |

oṃ maṃ māṃ miṃ mīṃ mum mūm mem maim mom mauṃ maḥ

oṃ mam mām mim mīm mum mūm mem maim mom maum maṃ maḥ

mama hṛdayādivāmabāhu rakṣantu mama | oṃ mam mām mim mīm mum mūm mem maim mom maum maṃ maḥ dakṣapādaṃ rakṣantu mama | vāmapādaṃ rakṣantu mama sadā svāhā svāhā svāhā |

oṃ mam mām mim mīm mum mūm mem maim mom maum maṃ maḥ
mama hṛdādiṣu nāsāṃ rakṣantu svāhā | oṃ mam mām mim mīm mum mūm mem maim mom maum maṃ maḥ upasthaṃ rakṣantu mama sadā svāhā | oṃ mam mām mim mīm mum mūm mem maim mom maum maṃ maḥ ||

idaṃ hi yonikavacaṃ rahasyaṃ paramādbhutam |

ajñātvā yo japenmantraṃ sarvaṃ niṣphalatāṃ vrajet || 84 ||

rahasyaṃ paramaṃ divyaṃ sāvadhānā'vadhāraya |

mūlādhāre maheśāni japed yantraṃ varānane || 85 ||

mūlādhāre maheśāni varārohe'ntarātmani |

praticakre maheśāni paṭhed yoniṃ sanātanīm || 86 ||

candrasūryoparāge ca paṭhed vā kavacaṃ priye |

svanārīṃ ramayed yantre paranārīmathāpi vā || 87 ||

kavacasya prasādena yonimudrā hi siddhyati |

idaṃ hi kavacaṃ devi paṭhitvā kamalānane || 88 ||

maithunaṃ mahadākhyānaṃ tvayā saha mayā kṛtam |

kavacasya prasādena janā yānti parāṃ gatim || 89 ||

bhūrjapatre samālikhya svayaṃbhūkusumena tu |

śuklena kusumenāpi rocanālaktakena ca || 90 ||

svarṇasthāṃ guṭikāṃ kṛtvā dhārayed yantramānavaḥ (?) |

iha loke paratre ca sa eva śrīsadāśivaḥ || 91 ||

aṣṭottaraśatañcāsya prapaṭhet siddhi vāñchayā |

kimatra bahunoktena asmāt parataro nahi |

namo yonyai namo yonyai kuṇḍalinyai namo namaḥ || 92 ||

[iti dakṣiṇāmnāye sārdhalakṣagranthe kaṅkālamālinītantre yonimudrādikathanaṃ dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 2 ||

[atha tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ]


śrīdevī uvāca


idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi gurupūjanamuttamam ||


śrī(-)īśvara uvāca


kathayāmi mahādevi aprakāśyaṃ varānane |

nirguṇañca paraṃ brahma gururityakṣaradvayam || 1 ||

mahāmantraṃ maheśāni gopanīyaṃ parātparam |

tatra dhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu pārvati sādaram || 2 ||

sahasradalapadmasthamantarātmānamujjvalam |

tasyopari nādabindormadhye siṃhāsanojjvale || 3 ||

cintayennijaguruṃ nityaṃ rajatācalasannibham |

vīrāsanasamāsīnaṃ mudrābharaṇabhūṣitam || 4 ||

śubhramālyāmbaradharaṃ varadābhayapāṇinam |

vāmoruśaktisahitaṃ kāruṇyenāvalokitam || 5 ||

priyayā savyahastena dhṛtacārukalevaram |

vāmenotpaladhāriṇyā raktābharaṇabhūṣayā || 6 ||

jñānānandasamāyuktaṃ svarettannāmapūrvakam |

mānasaistūpacāraiśca saṃpūjya kalpayet sudhīḥ || 7 ||

gandhaṃ bhūmyātmakaṃ dadyād bhāvapuṣpaistataḥ param |

dhūpaṃ vāyvātmakaṃ devi tejasā dīpameva ca || 8 ||

naivedyamamṛtaṃ dadyāt pānīyaṃ varuṇātmakam |

ambaraṃ mukuṭaṃ dadyāt vastrañcaiva mama priye || 9 ||

cāmaraṃ pādukācchatraṃ tathālaṅkārabhūṣaṇaiḥ |

tattanmudrāvidhānena saṃpūjyātha guruṃ yajet || 10 ||

yathāśakti japaṃ kṛtvā samarpya kavacaṃ paṭhet |

iti te kathitaṃ samyag gurupūjanamuttamam || 11 ||


śrīdevī uvāca


bhūtanātha mahādeva kavacaṃ tasya me vada || 12 ||


śrī(-)īśvara uvāca


atha te kathayāmīśe kavacaṃ mokṣadāyakam |

yasya jñānaṃ vinā devi na siddhirna ca sadgatiḥ || 13 ||

brahmādayo'pi girije sarvatra jayinaḥ smṛtāḥ |

asya prasādāt sakalā vedāgamapuraḥsarāḥ || 14 ||

kavacasyāsya deveśi ṛṣirviṣṇurudāhṛtaḥ |

chando virāḍ devatā ca gurudevaḥ svayaṃ śivaḥ || 15 ||

caturvarge jñānamārge viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |

sahasrāre mahāpadme karpūradhavalo guruḥ || 16 ||

vāmorugataśaktiryaḥ sarvataḥ parirakṣatu |

paramākhyo guruḥ pātu śirasaṃ ma vallabhe || 17 ||

parāparākhyo nāsāṃ me parameṣṭhirmukhaṃ mama |

kaṇṭhaṃ mama sadā pātu prahlādānandanāthakaḥ || 18 ||

bāhū dvau sanakānandaḥ kumārānandanāyakaḥ |

vaśiṣṭhanandanāthaśca hṛdayaṃ pātu sarvadā || 17 ||

krodhānandaḥ kaṭiṃ pātu sukhānandaḥ padaṃ mama |

dhyānānandaśca sarvāṅgaṃ bodhānandaśca kānane || 20 ||

sarvatra guravaḥ pāntu sarve īśvararūpiṇaḥ |

iti te kathitaṃ bhadre kavacaṃ paramaṃ śive || 21 ||

bhaktihīne durācāre dadyānmṛtyumavāpnuyāt |

asyaiva paṭhanād devi dhāraṇācchravaṇāt priye || 22 ||

mantrāḥ siddhāśca jāyante kimanyat kathayāmi te |

kaṇṭhe vā dakṣiṇe bāhau śikhāyāṃ vīravandite || 23 ||

dhāraṇānnāśayet pāpaṃ gaṅgāyāṃ kaluṣaṃ yathā |

idaṃ kavacamajñātvā yadi mantraṃ japet priye || 24 ||

tat sarvaṃ niṣphalaṃ kṛtvā gururyāti suniścitam |

śive ruṣṭe gurustrātā gurau ruṣṭe na kaścana || 25 ||


śrīpārvatī uvāca


lokeśa kathyatām deva gurugītā mayi prabho || 26 ||


śrīśiva uvāca


śṛṇu tāriṇi vakṣyāmi gītāṃ brahmamayīṃ parām |

guruḥ svayaṃ sarvaśāstrāṇāmahameva prakāśakaḥ || 27 ||

tvameva gururūpeṇa lokānāṃ prāṇakāriṇī |

gayā gaṅgā kāśikā ca tvameva sakalaṃ jagat || 28 ||

kāverī yamunā revā karatoyā sarasvatī |

candrabhāgā gautamī ca tvameva kulapālikā || 29 ||

brahmāṇḍaṃ sakalaṃ devi koṭibrahmāṇḍameva ca |

nahi te vaktumarhāmi kriyājālaṃ maheśvari || 30 ||

uktvā uktvā bhāvayitvā bhikṣuko'yaṃ nagātmaje |

kathaṃ tvaṃ jananī bhūtvā badhūstvaṃ mama dehinām || 31 ||

tava cakraṃ maheśāni atītaṃ paramātmanaḥ |

iti te kathitā gītā gurudevasya brahmaṇaḥ || 32 ||

saṃkṣepeṇa maheśāni prabhureva guruḥ svayam |

jagat samastamastheyaṃ gurustheyo hi kevalam || 33 ||

taṃ toṣayitvā deveśi natibhistattribhistathā |

nānāvidhadravyadānaiḥ siddhiḥ syāt sādhakottamaḥ || 34 ||

[iti śrīdakṣiṇāmnāye sārdhalakṣagranthe kaṅkālamālinītantre śrīgurupūjanakavacagurugītā nāma tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 3 ||

[atha caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ]


śrīpārvatī uvāca


kathayasva virūpākṣa mahākālīmanuṃ prabho |


śrī(-)īśvara uvāca


athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi mahākālīmanuṃ priye |

yasya vijñānamātreṇa sarvasiddhīśvaro bhavet || 2 ||

śriyā viṣṇuṃ mama kāntyā sammukhena samaḥ sukhī |

śaucena śucinā tulyo balena pavanopamaḥ || 3 ||

vāgīśvaraḥ samo vāci dhanena dhanapaḥ svayam |

sārvajñe śambhunā tulyo dāne dādhīcinā samaḥ || 4 ||

ājñayā devarājo'sau brāhmaṇyena prajāpatiḥ |

bhṛgoriva tapasvī ca candravat prītivardhanaḥ || 5 ||

tejasāgnisamo bhaktyā nāradaḥ śivakṛṣṇayoḥ |

rūpeṇa madanaḥ sākṣāt pratāpe bhānusannibhaḥ || 6 ||

śāstracarcāsvāṅgiraso jāmadagnyaḥ pratijñayā |

siddhānāṃ bhairavaḥ sākṣāt gaṅgeva malanāśakaḥ || 7 ||

athavā bahunoktena kiṃ vā tena varānane |

na tasya dūritaṃ kiñcit mahākālīṃ smareddhiyā || 8 ||

śabdabrahmamayīṃ svāhāṃ bhogamokṣaikadāyikām |

bhogena mokṣamāpnoti śrutvā gurumukhāt parām || 9 ||

tāṃ vidyāṃ śṛṇu vakṣyāmi yayā bhairavatāṃ vrajet |

krodhīśaṃ kṣatajārūḍhaṃ dhūmrabhairavyalakṣitam || 10 ||

nādabindusamāyuktaṃ mantraṃ svarge'pi durlabham |

ekākṣarīsamā nāsti vidyā tribhuvane priye || 11 ||

mahākālī guhyavidyā kalikāle ca siddhidā |

athānyat saṃpravakṣyāmi dakṣiṇāṃ kālikāṃ parām || 12 ||

vāgbhavaṃ bījamuccārya kāmarājaṃ tataḥ param |

māyābījaṃ tato bhadre tryakṣaraṃ mantramīritam || 13 ||

kāmarājaṃ tato kūrcaṃ māyābījamataḥ param |

aparaṃ tryakṣaraṃ proktaṃ pūrvoktaṃ phaladaṃ priye || 14 ||

hālāhalaṃ samuccārya māyādvayamataḥ param |

etattu tryakṣaraṃ devi sarvakāmaphalapradam || 15 ||

eteṣāñcaiva mantrāṇāṃ phalamanyat śṛṇu priye |

na kālaniyamo'trāsti nārimitrādidūṣaṇam || 16 ||

kāyakleśakaraṃ naiva prayāso nāsya sādhane |

divā vā yadi vā rātrau japaḥ sarvatra śobhanaḥ || 17 ||

bhogamokṣavirodho'tra sādhane nāsti niścitam |

bhogena labhate mokṣaṃ naro'pi vidyayānayā || 18 ||

asyā japāttathā dhyānāt labhenmuktiṃ caturvidhām |

nānayā sadṛśī vidyā nānayā sadṛśo japaḥ || 19 ||

nānayā sadṛśaṃ dhyānaṃ nānayā sadṛśaṃ tapaḥ |

satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ satyaṃ satyapūrvaṃ vadāmyaham || 20 ||

anayā sadṛśī vidyā nāsti siddhiḥ sugocare |

atha saṃkṣepato vakṣye pūjāvidhimanuttamam || 21 ||

vistāre kasya vā śaktiḥ ko vā jānāti tattvataḥ |

pūjā ca trividhā proktā nityanaimittikāmyataḥ || 22 ||

tatraiva nityapūjāñca vakṣye tāñca niśāmaya |

bhairavo'sya ṛṣiḥ prokta uṣṇik chanda udāhṛtam || 23 ||

devatā munibhiḥ proktā mahākālī purātanī |

viniyogastu vidyāyāḥ puruṣārthacatuṣṭaye || 24 ||

pañcaśuddhivihīnena yatkṛtaṃ na ca tatkṛtam |

pañcaśuddhiṃ vinā pūjā abhicārāya kalpyate || 25 ||

ātmaśuddhiḥ sthānaśuddhirdravyasya śodhanastathā |

mantraśuddhirdevaśuddhiḥ pañcaśuddhiritīritā || 26 ||

bhūpradeśe same śuddhiḥ puṣpaḥ prakarasaṃkule |

āsanaṃ kalpayedādau komalaṃ kambalantu vā || 27 ||

vāme gurūn punarnatvā dakṣiṇe gaṇapatiṃ vibhum |

bhūtaśuddhiṃ tathā kuryāt pūjāyogyā yathā bhavet || 28 ||

prāṇāyāmādi vidhivat ṛṇyādinyāsamācaret |

ādau śuddhibhairavāya ṛṣaye nama ityatha || 29 ||

uṣṇik chandase namasā mukhe chando vinirdiśet |

mama priye mahākālī devatāyai namo hṛdi || 30 ||

hrīṃ bījāya namaḥ pūrvaṃ huṃ śaktaye namo'pyatha |

kavitvārthe viniyoga iti vinyasya vāñchayā || 31 ||

kevalāṃ mātṛkāṃ nyasya bījanyāsa samācaret |

oṃ krā(/) aṅguṣṭhayornyasya oṃ krī(/) tarjanyornamaḥ || 32 ||

oṃ kra(/) madhyamayornyasya oṃ krai(/) anāmikādvayoḥ |

oṃ krau(/) kaniṣṭhāyugale oṃ kraḥ karatale tathā || 33 ||

punarhṛdayādiṣvetairjātiyuktaiḥ ṣaḍaṅgakam |

ṣaḍadīrghabhāvaṃ svabījaiḥ praṇavādyaistu vinyaset || 34 ||

varṇanyāsaṃ tathā kuryād yena devīmayo bhavet |

a ā i ī u ū ṛ ṝ ḷ ḹ ca hṛdaye nyaset || 35 ||

e ai o au aṃ aḥ ka kha ga gha vai dakṣiṇe bhuje |

ṅa ca cha ja jha ña ṭa ṭha ḍa ḍha vai vāmake bhuje || 36 ||

ṇa ta tha da dha na pa pha ba bha dakṣajaṅghake nyaset |

ma ya ra la va śa ṣa sa ha la kṣa vāmajaṅghake || 37 ||

pañcadhā saptadhā vāpi mūlavidyāṃ samuccaran |

śira(-)ādi ca pādāntaṃ nyased vyāpakamuttam || 38 ||

nityanyāsa iti proktaḥ sarva eva sukhāvahaḥ |

atha dhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi bhairavākāradāyakam || 39 ||

himālayagirermadhye nagare bhairavasya ca |

divyasthāne mahāpīṭhe maṇimaṇḍaparājite || 40 ||

nāradādyairmuniśreṣṭhaiḥ saṃsevitapadāmbujām |

tatra dhyāyenmahākālīmādyāṃ bhairavanditām || 41 ||

nīlendīvaravarṇinīṃ yugmāpīnatuṅgastanīm
suptaśrīharipīṭharājitavatīṃ bhīmāṃ trinetrāṃ śivām |
mudrākhaḍgakarāṃ varābhayayutāṃ citrāmbaroddīpanīṃ
vande cañcalacandrakāntamaṇibhirmālāṃ dadhānāṃ parām || 42 ||

dhyānāntaraṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇa gauri gireḥ sute |

tatra pīṭhe mahādevīṃ kālīṃ dānavasevitām || 43 ||

meghāṅgī vigatāmbarāṃ śavaśirārūḍhāṃ trinetrāṃ parāṃ
karṇālambitabāṇayugmalasitāṃ muṇḍāvalīmaṇḍitām |

vāmādhordhva karāmbuje naraśiraḥkhaḍgañca savyetare |

dānābhītivimuktakeśanicayā dhyeyā sadā kālikā || 44 ||

aparañca pravakṣyāmi dhyānaṃ paramadurlabham |

kālīṃ karālavadanāṃ ghoradaṃṣṭrāṃ trilocanām || 45 ||

smareccharakaraśreṇikṛtakāñcīṃ digambarām |

vīrāsanasamāsīnāṃ mahākālopari sthitām || 46 ||

śrutimūlasamākīrṇāṃ sṛkkaṇīṃ ghoranādinīm |

muṇḍamālāgaladraktacarcitāṃ pīvarastanīm || 47 ||

madirāmoditāsphālakampitākhilamedinīm |

vāme khaḍgaṃ chinnamuṇḍaṃ dhāriṇīṃ dakṣiṇe kare || 48 ||

varābhayayutāṃ ghoravadanāṃ lolajihvikām |

śakuntapakṣasaṃyuktavāṇakarṇavibhūṣitām || 49 ||

śivābhirghorarāvābhiḥ sevitāṃ pralayoditām |

caṇḍahāsacaṇḍanādacaṇḍākhyānaiśca bhairavaiḥ || 50 ||

gṛhītvā narakaṅkālaṃ jayaśabdaparāyaṇaiḥ |

sevitākhilasiddhaughairmunibhiḥ sevitāṃ parām || 51 ||

eṣāmanyatamaṃ dhyānaṃ kṛtvā ca sādhakottamaḥ |

mānasairupacāraiśca so'hamātmānamarcayet || 52 ||

tato devīṃ samabhyarcya arghyadvayaṃ nivedayet |

daśapañcārapadmeṣu pīṭhapūjāṃ samācaret || 53 ||

tatrāvāhya mahādevīṃ niyamena samāhitaḥ |

tato dhyāyenmahādevīṃ kālikāṃ kulabhūṣaṇām || 54 ||

mahākālaṃ yajeddyatnāt pīṭhaśaktiṃ tato yajet |

kālīṃ kapālinīṃ kullāṃ kurukullāṃ virodhinīm || 55 ||

vipracittāṃ tathā caiva vahiḥ ṣaṭkoṇake punaḥ |

ugrāmugraprabhāṃ dīptāṃ tatra trikoṇake punaḥ || 56 ||

mahākālaṃ yajedyatnātpīṭhaśaktiṃ tatoyajet |

kālīṃ kṛpālinī kullāṃ kurukullāṃ virodhinīm || 57 ||

vipraciṃttāṃ tathā caiva vahiḥ ṣaṭkoṇake punaḥ |

ugrāmugreprabhāṃ dīptāṃ tatra trikoṇake punaḥ || 58 ||

nīlāṃ ghanāṃ valākāñca tathā paratrikoṇake |

mātrāṃ mudrāṃ nityāñcaiva tathaivāntastrikoṇake || 59 ||

sarvā śyāmā asikarā muṇḍamālāvibhūṣaṇā |

tarjanīṃ vāmahastena dhārayantī śucismitā || 60 ||

brāhmyādyāstathāvāhya yajet pūrvadalakramāt |

brāhmī nārāyaṇī caiva tathaiva ca maheśvarī || 61 ||

cāmuṇḍāpi ca kaumārī tathā caivātra rājitā |

vārāhī ca tathā pūjyā nārasiṃhī tathaiva ca || 62 ||

sarvāsāmapi dātavyā baliḥ pūjā tathaiva ca |

anulepanakaṃ gandhaṃ dhūpadīpau ca pānakam || 63 ||

tristriḥ pūjā ca kartavyā sarvāsāmapi sādhakaiḥ |

punargandhādibhiḥ pūjya japtvā śeṣaṃ samarpayet || 64 ||

samayaṃ cārcayed devyā yoginīyogibhiḥ saha |

madhu māṃsaṃ tathā matsyaṃ yat kiñca kulasādhanam || 65 ||

śaktyai datvā tataḥ paścād gurave vinivedayet |

tadanujñāṃ mūrdhni kṛtvā śeṣaṃ cātmani yojayet || 66 ||

madhu māṃsaṃ vinā yastu kulapūjāṃ samācaret |

janmāntarasahasrasya sukṛtistasya naśyati || 67 ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena makārapañcakairyajet |

madhunā na vinā mantraṃ na mantreṇa vinā madhu || 68 ||

parasparavirodhena kathaṃ sidhyanti sādhakāḥ |

kuṇḍakumbhakapālādipadārthānāṃ niṣevaṇam || 69 ||

saure tantre viruddhaṃ ca śaive śākte mahāphalam |

brahmāṇḍakhaṇḍasambhūtamaśeṣaratnasambhavam || 70 ||

śvetaṃ pītaṃ sugandhaṃ ca nirmalaṃ bhūritejasam |

athavā kumbhamadhye'smin sravantaṃ paramāmṛtam || 71 ||

antarlayo bahirmadhye trikoṇodaravartini |

tad vāhyaṃ sphāṭikodāramaṇicandraṃ ca maṇḍalam || 72 ||

tenāmṛtena tadbāhye cintayet paramāmṛtam |

ārambhastaruṇaḥ prauḍhastadante taruṇaḥ punaḥ || 73 ||

ebhirullāsavān yogī svayaṃ śivamayo yataḥ |

sarvaśeṣe ca deveśi sāmānyārghyaṃ pade'rpayet || 74 ||

viśeṣārghyaṃ śive datvā devyāḥ priyatamo bhavet |

sāṅgakriyāṃ pade datvā sāmānyārghyaṃ śive bhavet || 75 ||

ityuktvā sa parāmarṣī(rśī) śaktitoṣaṇakārakaḥ |

bhogena labhate mokṣaṃ bahunā jalpitena kim || 76 ||

niyamaḥ puruṣe jñeyo na yoṣitsu kadācana |

yadvā tadvā yena kena sarvadā sarvato'pi ca || 77 ||

yoṣitāṃ dhyānayogena śuddhaśeṣaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |

bālāṃ vā yauvanonmattāṃ vṛddhāṃ vā yuvatīṃ tathā || 78 ||

kutsitāṃ vā mahāduṣṭāṃ namaskṛtya visarjayet |

tāsāṃ prahāro nindā ca kauṭilyamapriyaṃ tathā || 79 ||

sarvathā na ca kartavyamanyathā siddhirodhakṛt |

iti te kathitaṃ śeṣamācared lakṣaṇaṃ priye ||

nityapūjākramaṃ bhaktyā jñātvā siddhimavāpnuyāt || 80 ||


[iti dakṣiṇāmnāye kaṅkālamālinītantre sārdhalakṣagranthe mahākālīmantrapūjākathanaṃ nāma caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 4 ||

[pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

śrīpārvatī uvāca


kathayasva mahābhāga puraścaraṇamuttamam |

kasmin kāle ca kartavyaṃ kalau siddhidamadbhutam || 1 ||


śrī(-)īśvara uvāca


sāmānyataḥ pravakṣyāmi puraścaryāvidhiṃ śṛṇu |

nāśubho vidyate kālo nāśubho vidyate kvacit || 2 ||

na viśeṣo divārātrau na sandhyāyāṃ mahāniśi |

kālākālaṃ maheśāni bhrāntimātraṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 3 ||

pralaye mahati prāpte sarvaṃ gacchati brahmaṇi |

tatkāle ca mahābhīme ko gacchati śubhāśubham || 4 ||

kalikāle mahāmāye bhavantyalpāyuṣo janāḥ |

anirdiṣṭāyuṣaḥ sarve kālacintā kathaṃ priye || 5 ||

yatkālaṃ brahmacintāyāṃ tatkālaṃ saphalaṃ priye |

puraścaryāvidhau devi kālacintāṃ na cācaret || 6 ||

nātra śuddhyādyapekṣāsti na niṣiddhādidūṣaṇam |

dikkālaniyamo nātra sthityādiniyamo nahi || 7 ||

na jape kālaniyamo nārcādiṣvapi sundari |

svecchācāro'tra niyamo mahāmantrasya sādhane || 8 ||

nādharmo vidyate subhru pracared hṛṣṭamānasaḥ |

jambūdvīpe ca varṣe ca kalau bhāratasaṃjñake || 9 ||

ṣaṇmāsādapi girije japāt siddhirna saṃśayaḥ |

yannoktaṃ sarvatantreṣu tadadya kathayāmi te || 10 ||

subhage śṛṇu cārvaṅgi kalyāṇi kamalekṣaṇe |

kalau ca bhārate varṣe yena siddhiḥ prajāyate || 11 ||

tatsarvaṃ kathayāmyadya sāvadhānā'vadhāraya |

kalikāle varārohe japamātraṃ praśasyate || 12 ||

na tithirna vrataṃ homaṃ snānaṃ sandhyā praśasyate |

puraścaryāṃ vinā devi kalau mantraṃ na sādhayet || 13 ||

satyatretāyugaṃ devi dvāparaṃ sukhasādhanam |

kalikāle durāgharṣaṃ sarvaduḥkhamayaṃ sadā || 14 ||

sāraṃ hi sarvatantrāṇāṃ mahākālīṣu kathyate |

prātaḥkṛtyādikaṃ kṛtvā tataḥ snānaṃ samācaret || 15 ||

kṛtvā sandhyāṃ tarpaṇaṃ ca saṃkṣepeṇa varānane |

pūjāṃ caiva varārohe yasya yat paṭalakramāt || 16 ||

pūjādvāre ca vinyasya baliṃ dadyād yathākramam |

prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ caiva māṣabhaktabaliṃ tathā || 17 ||

saṅkalpyopāsya deveśi balidānasya sādhakaḥ |

ādau gaṇapaterbījaṃ gamityekākṣaraṃ viduḥ || 18 ||

bhūmau vilikhya guptena baliṃ piṇḍopamaṃ tataḥ |

oṃ gaṃ gaṇapataye svāhā iti mantreṇa sādhakaḥ || 19 ||

balimitthaṃ ca sarvatra bījopari pradāpayet |

oṃ bhairavāya tataḥ svāhā bhairavāya baliṃ tataḥ || 20 ||

oṃ kṣaṃ kṣetrapālāya svāhā kṣetrapālabaliṃ tataḥ |

oṃ yāṃ yoginibhyo namaḥ svāhā ca yoginībalim || 21 ||

saṃpūjya vidhinā dadyāt pūrvavat kramato balim |

kathopakathanaṃ devi tyajedatra surālaye || 22 ||

pūrve gaṇapaterbhadre uttare bhairavāya ca |

paścime kṣetrapālāya yoginyai dakṣiṇe dadet || 23 ||

indrādibhyo baliṃ dadyādātmakalyāṇahetave |

tadā siddhimavāpnoti cānyathā hāsyakevalam || 24 ||

palaikaṃ māṣakalkañca palamekañca taṇḍulam |

arddhatolaṃ ghṛtañcaiva dadhi arddhārddhatolakam || 25 ||

śarkaraikatolakena baliṃ dadyāt susiddhaye |

eteṣāṃ sahayogena balirbhavati śāmbhavi || 26 ||

pūjāsthāne tathā bhadre kūrmabījaṃ likhet tataḥ |

candrabindumayaṃ bījaṃ kūmabījaṃ itīritam || 27 ||

sthāpayedāsanaṃ tatra pūjayet paṭalakramāt |

bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā prāṇāyāmaṃ tataḥ param || 28 ||

aṅganyāsaṃ karanyāsaṃ mātṛkānyāsameva ca |

yaḥ kuryānmātṛkānyāsaṃ sa śivo nātra saṃśayaḥ || 29 ||

tatastu bhīmatilakaṃ rudrākṣaṃ dhārayettataḥ |

rudrākṣasya ca māhātmyaṃ bhasmanaśca śṛṇu priye || 30 ||

āgneyamucyate bhasma dugdhagomayasambhavam |

śodhayenmūlamantreṇa aṣṭottaraśataṃ japan || 31 ||

śirodeśe lalāṭe ca skandhayorbhrūpradeśake |

bāhvoḥ pārśvadvaye devi kaṇṭhadeśe hṛdi priye || 32 ||

śrutiyugme pṛṣṭhadeśe nābhau tuṇḍe maheśvari |

kūrparād bāhuparyantaṃ kakṣe grīvāsu pārvati || 33 ||

sarvāṅge lepayad devi kimanyat kathayāmi te |

madhyamānāmikāṅgulyaṅguṣṭhena tilakaṃ tataḥ || 34 ||

tilakaṃ tu trirekhaṃ syād rekhāṇāṃ navadhā matam |

pṛthivyagnistathā śaktiḥ kriyāśaktirmaheśvaraḥ || 35 ||

devaḥ prathamarekhāyāṃ bhaktyā te parikīrtitaḥ |

na bhasmāṃścaiva subhage dvitīyā caiva devatā || 36 ||

paramātmā śivo devastṛtīyāyāśca devatā |

etānnityaṃ namaskṛtya tripuṇḍraṃ dhārayed yadi || 37 ||

maheśvaravratamidaṃ kṛtvā siddhīśvaro bhavet |

brahmacārī gṛhastho vā vanastho vā yatistathā || 38 ||

mahāpātakasaṃghātairmucyate sarvapātakāt |

tathā'nyakṣatraviṭśūdrastrīhatyādiṣu pātakaiḥ || 39 ||

vīrabrāhmaṇahatyābhirmucyate subhageśvari |

amantreṇāpi yaḥ kuryād jñātvā ca mahimonnatim || 40 ||

tripuṇḍrabhālatilako mucyate sarvapātakaiḥ |

paradravyāpaharaṇaṃ paradārābhimarṣaṇam || 41 ||

paranindā parakṣetraharaṇaṃ parapīḍanam |

asatyavākyapaiśunyaṃ pāruṣyaṃ devavikrayam || 42 ||

kūṭasākṣyaṃ vratatyāgaṃ kaitavaṃ nīcasevanam |

gomṛgāṇāṃ hiraṇyasya tilakambalavāsasām || 43 ||

annadhānyakuśādīnāṃ nīcebhyo'pi parigraham |

dāsīveśyāsu kṛṣṇāsu vṛṣalīsu nadīṣu ca || 44 ||

rajasvalāsu kanyāsu vidhavāsu ca saṅgame |

māṃsacarmarasādīnāṃ lavaṇasya ca vikrayam || 45 ||

evaṃrūpāṇyasaṃkhyāni pāpāni vividhāni ca |

sadya eva vinaśyanti tridaṇḍasya ca dhāraṇāt || 46 ||

śivadravyāpaharaṇāt śivanindāñca kutracit |

nindāyāḥ śivabhaktānāṃ prāyaścittairna śudhyati || 47 ||

tripuṇḍraṃ śirasā dhṛtvā tatkṣaṇādeva śudhyati |

devadravyāpaharaṇe brahmasvaharaṇena ca || 48 ||

kulānyagnaya evātra vinaśyanti sadāśive |

mahādevi mahābhāge brāhmaṇātikrameṇa ca || 49 ||

kularakṣā bhavatyasmāt tripuṇḍrasya ca sevanāt |

rudrākṣaṃ yasya deheṣu lalāṭeṣu tripuṇḍrakam || 50 ||

yadi syāt sa ca cāṇḍālaḥ sarvavarṇottamottamaḥ |

yāni tīrthāni loke'smin gaṅgādyāḥ saritaśca yāḥ || 51 ||

snāto bhavati sarvatra yallalāṭe tripuṇḍrakam |

saptakoṭimahāmantrā upamantrāstathaiva ca || 52 ||

śrīviṣṇoḥ koṭimantrāśca koṭimantrāḥ śivasya ca |

te sarve tena japtā ca yo bibharti tripuṇḍrakam || 53 ||

sahasraṃ pūrvajātānāṃ sahasraṃ ca janiṣyatām |

svavaṃśajātamartyānāmuddhared yastripuṇḍrakṛt || 54 ||

ṣaḍaiśvaryaguṇopetaḥ prāpya divyavapustataḥ |

divyaṃ vimānamāruhya divyāstraśatasevitaḥ || 55 ||

vidyādhāraṇāṃ siddhānāṃ gandharvāṇāṃ mahaujasām |

indrādilokapālānāṃ lokeṣu ca yathākramam || 56 ||

bhuktvā bhogān suvipulaṃ pradeśānāṃ pureṣu ca |

brahmaṇaḥ padamāsādya tatra kalpāyutaṃ vaset || 57 ||

viṣṇuloke ca ramate ābrahmaṇaḥ śatāyuṣam |

śivalokaṃ tataḥ prāpya ramate kālamakṣayam || 58 ||

śivasāyujyamāpnoti na sa bhūyo'pi jāyate |

śaive viṣṇau ca saure ca gāṇapatyeṣu pārvati || 59 ||

śaktirūpā ca yā gauḥ syāt tasyā gomayasambhavam |

bhasma teṣu maheśāni viśiṣṭaṃ parikīrtitam || 60 ||

śaivāpi ca varārohe sādguṇyaṃ varavarṇini |

śaktau praśastamokṣaṃ hi bhasma yauvanajīvane || 61 ||

anyeṣāṃ gokarīṣeṇa bhasma śaktyādikeṣvapi |

sāmānyametat suśroṇi viśeṣaṃ śṛṇu matpriye || 62 ||

karīṣabhasmādanaghe haumaṃ bhasma mahāphalam |

haumabhasmāt koṭiguṇaṃ viṣṇuhomaṃ maheśvari || 63 ||

śivahomaṃ taddviguṇaṃ bhasmāttu śṛṇu sundari |

svīyeṣṭadevatāhomamanantaṃ priyavādini || 64 ||

tanmāhātmyamahaṃ vaktuṃ kalpakoṭiśatairapi |

na samartho yogamārgo kimanyat kathayāmi te || 65 ||

homaḥ kaliyuge devi jambūdvīpasya varṣake |

bhāratākhye mahākāli daśāṃśaṃ kramataḥ śive || 66 ||

nāstikāste mahāmohe kevalaṃ homamācaret |

lakṣaṃ vāpyayutaṃ vāpi sahasraṃ vā varānane || 67 ||

aṣṭādhikaśataṃ vāpi kāmyahomaṃ prakalpayet |

nityahomaṃ ca kartavyaṃ śaktyā ca parameśvari || 68 ||

prajapennityapūjāyāmaṣṭottarasahasrakam |

aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi aṣṭapañcāśataṃ caret || 69 ||

aṣṭātriṃśatsaṃkhyakaṃ vā aṣṭāviṃśatimeva ca |

aṣṭādaśaṃ dvādaśaṃ ca daśāṣṭau ca vidhānataḥ || 70 ||

homaṃ caiva maheśāni etatsaṃkhyāvidhānataḥ |

evaṃ sarvatra deveśi nityakarmamahotsavaḥ || 71 ||

itthaṃ prakāraṃ yad bhasma aṅge saṃlipya sādhakaḥ |

mālāñcaiva maheśāni narāsthyadbhutapūjitām || 72 ||

gale dadyād varārohe śaktaśced divyanāyike |

rudrākṣamālyaṃ saṃdhāryaṃ tataḥ śṛṇu mama priye || 73 ||

evaṃ kṛtvā tvayā sārddhaṃ pitṛbhūmau sthitaṃ mayā |

subhage śṛṇu suśroṇi rudrākṣaṃ paramaṃ padam || 74 ||

sarvapāpakṣayakaraṃ rudrākṣaṃ brahmaṇīśvari |

abhukto vā'pi bhukto vā nīcānnīcataro'pi vā || 75 ||

rudrākṣaṃ dhārayed yastu mucyate sarvapātakāt |

rudrākṣadhāraṇaṃ puṇyaṃ kaivalyasadṛśaṃ bhavet || 76 ||

mahāvratamidaṃ puṇyaṃ trikoṭitīrthasaṃyutam |

sahasraṃ dhārayed yastu rudrākṣāṇāṃ śicismite || 77 ||

taṃ namanti surāḥ sarve yathā rudrastathaiva saḥ |

abhāve tu sahasrasya bāhvoḥ ṣoḍaśa ṣoḍaśa || 78 ||

ekaṃ śikhāyāṃ kavacayordvādaśa dvādaśa kramāt |

dvātriṃśat kaṇṭhadeśe tu catvāriṃśat śire tathā || 79 ||

ubhayoḥ karṇayoḥ ṣaṭ ṣaḍ hṛdi aṣṭottaraṃ śatam |

yo dhārayati rudrākṣān rudravat sa ca pūjitaḥ || 80 ||

muktāpravālasphaṭikaiḥ sūryendumaṇikāñcanaiḥ |

sametān dhārayed yastu rudrākṣān śiva eva saḥ || 81 ||

kevalānapi rudrākṣān yo bibharti varānane |

taṃ na spṛśanti pāpāni timirānīva bhāskaram || 82 ||

rudrākṣamālayā japto mantro'nantaphalapradaḥ |

yasyāṅge nāsti rudrākṣa eko'pi varavarṇini || 83 ||

tasya janma nirarthaṃ syāt tripuṇḍrarahitaṃ yathā |

rudrākṣaṃ mastake badhvā śiraḥsnānaṃ karoti yaḥ || 84 ||

gaṅgāsnānaphalaṃ tasya jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |

rudrākṣaṃ pūjayed yastu vinā toyābhiṣecanaiḥ || 85 ||

yatphalaṃ śivapūjāyāṃ tadevāpnoti niścitam |

ekavaktraiḥ pañcavaktraistrayodaśamukhaistathā || 86 ||

caturdaśamukhairjaptvā sarvasiddhiḥ prajāyate |

kiṃ bahūktyā varārohe kṛtvā gatikamadbhutam || 87 ||

rudrākṣaṃ yatnato dhṛtvā śiva eva sa sādhakaḥ |

bhasmanā tilakaṃ kṛtvā paścād rudrākṣadhāraṇam || 88 ||

prāṇāyāmaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā saṃkalpyopāsya sādhakaḥ |

mūlamantrasiddhikāmaḥ kuryācca varṇapūjanam || 89 ||

ṣaṭtriṃśadvarṇamālārcā vistāronnatiśālinī |

vilipya candanaṃ śuddhaṃ sarvavarṇātmake ghaṭe || 90 ||

sarvāvayavasaṃyuktān vilikhya mātṛkākṣarān |

guruṃ saṃpūjya vidhivad ghaṭasthāpanamācaret || 91 ||

pañcāśamātṛkāvarṇān pūjayed vibhavakramāt |

pañcopacāraiḥ saṃpūjya dhyānaṃ kṛtvā prasannadhīḥ || 92 ||

śuklavidyutpratīkāśāṃ dvibhujāṃ lolalocanām |

kṛṣṇāmbaraparidhānāṃ śuklavastrottarīyiṇīm || 93 ||

nānābharaṇabhūṣāḍhyāṃ sindūratilakojjvalām |

kaṭākṣaviśikhoddīptāmajjanāñcitalocanām || 94 ||

mantrasiddhipradāṃ nityāṃ dhyāyet sattvasvarūpiṇīm |

raktavidyutpratīkāśāṃ dvibhujāṃ lolalocanām || 95 ||

śuklāmbaraparīdhānāṃ kṛṣṇavastrottarīyiṇīm |

nānābharaṇabhūṣāḍhyāṃ sindūratilakojjvalām || 96 ||

kaṭākṣaviśikhoddīptāmañjanāñcitalocanām |

mantrasiddhipradāṃ nityāṃ dhyāyed rajaḥsvarūpiṇīm || 97 ||

bhramadbhramarasaṃkāśāṃ dvibhujāṃ lolalocanām |

raktavastraparīdhānāṃ kṛṣṇavastrottarīyiṇīm || 98 ||

nānābharaṇabhūṣāḍhyāṃ sindūratilakojjvalām |

kaṭākṣaviśikhoddīptāṃ bhrūlatāparisevitām || 99 || 

mantrasiddhipradāṃ nityāṃ dhyāyet tamaḥ svarūpiṇīm |

dhyātvā pādyādikaṃ datvā triguṇāṃ pūjayet kramāt || 100 ||

oṃ ūṅkārarūpiṇyai namaḥ pādyaiḥ prapūjayet |

ādidhyānena subhage yajet sattvamayīṃ parām || 101 ||

oṃ kaṅkārarūpiṇyai namaḥ pādyādibhiryajet |

kramāt saptadaśārṇaṃ hi dvitīyaṃ dhyānamācaran || 102 ||

oṃ daṃkārarūpiṇyai namaḥ pādyādibhiryajet |

kramāt saptadaśārṇaṃ hi tṛtīyaṃ dhyānamācaran || 103 ||

evaṃ krameṇa pañcāśadvavarṇān hi paripūjayet |

iti te kathitaṃ bhadre pañcāśadvarṇapūjanam || 104 ||

varṇānāṃ pūjanād bhadre devapūjā prajāyate |

aṇimādyaṣṭasiddhīnāṃ pūjā syād varṇapūjanāt || 105 ||

saptakoṭimahāvidyā upavidyā tathaiva ca |

śrīviṣṇoḥ koṭimantrāśca koṭimantrāḥ śivasya ca || 106 ||

pūjanāt pūjitaṃ sarvaṃ varṇānāṃ siddhidāyakam |

prathamaṃ praṇavaṃ datvā sahasraṃ kuṇḍalīmukhe || 107 ||

mūlavidyāṃ tato bhadre sahasrayugalaṃ japet |

tatastu subhage mātarjapecca dīpinīṃ parām || 108 ||

ādau gāyatrīmuccārya mūlamantraṃ tataḥ param |

praṇavaṃ ca tato bhīme bhayānāṃ sahayogataḥ || 109 ||

sadaivaināṃ maheśāni dīpinīṃ parikīrtitām |

etāmapi sahasraṃ ca prajapet kuṇḍalīmukhe || 110 ||

praṇavādau japed vidyāṃ gāyatryāṃ dīpinīṃ parām |

gāyatrīṃ śṛṇu vakṣyāmi a(/) ṅa(/) ma(/) ma(/) ṅa(/) na(/) priye || 111 ||

ṣaḍakṣaramidaṃ mantraṃ gāyatrī samudīritam |

asyāśca phalamāpnoti tadaiva varavarṇini || 112 ||

smaraṇaṃ kuṇḍalīmadhye manasā unmanī saha |

sahasrāre karṇikāyāṃ candramaṇḍalamadhyagām || 113 ||

sarvasaṃkalparahitā kalā saptadaśī bhavet |

unmanīnāma tasya hi bhavapāśanikṛntanī || 114 ||

unmanyā sahito yogī na yogī unmanīṃ vinā |

buddhimaṅkuśasaṃyuktāmunmanīṃ kusumānvitām || 115 ||

unmanīñca manovarṇaṃ smaraṇāt siddhidāyinīm |

smaret kuṇḍalīyogādamṛtaṃ raktarociṣam |

unmanīkusumaṃ tattu jñeyaṃ paramadurlabham || 116 ||

haṃsaṃ nityamanantamadhyamaguṇaṃ svādhārato nirgatāṃ
śaktiṃ kuṇḍalinī samastajananī haste gṛhītvā ca tām |
kāntā svāśramamarkakoṭirucirā nāmāmṛtollāsinī
devīṃ tāṃ gamanāgamaiḥ sthiramatirdhyāyed jaganmohinīm || 117 ||

iti te kathitaṃ dhyānaṃ mṛtyuñjayamanāmayam |

vinā manonmanīmantraṃ vinā dhyānaṃ japaṃ vṛthā || 118 ||

tataḥ saṃkalpya dhyātvaiva mūlamantrasya siddhaye |

gāyatrīmayutaṃ japtvā tadardhaṃ praṇavaṃ japet || 119 ||

dīpanaṃ praṇavasyārdhaṃ japet pañcadināvadhi |

śūdrāṇāṃ praṇavaṃ devi caturdaśasvaraṃ priye || 120 ||

nādabindusamāyuktaṃ strīṇāṃ caiva varānane |

manau svāhā ca yā devī śūdroccāryā na saṃśayaḥ || 121 ||

homakārye maheśāni śūdraḥ svāhāṃ na coccaret |

mantro'pyūho nāsti śūdre viṣabījaṃ vinā priye || 122 ||

gaṇapatyādyau yad dattaṃ balidānaṃ dine dine |

tenaiva balinā bhadre haviṣyaṃ sammataṃ sadā || 123 ||

śeṣa iṣṭaṃ prapūjyātha haviṣyāśī striyā saha |

jāpakasya ca yanmantramekavarṇaṃ tataḥ priye || 124 ||

tasya patnī sābhirūpā prayataṃ prajapet yadi |

tadā phalamavāpnoti sādhakaḥ śaktisaṅgataḥ || 125 ||

śaktihīne bhaved duḥkhaṃ koṭipuraścaraṇena kim |

sādhakaśca haviṣyāśī sādhikā tadvivarjitā || 126 ||

yathecchābhojanaṃ tasyāstāmbūlapūritānanā |

nānābharaṇaveṣāḍhyā dhūpāmodanamoditā || 127 ||

śivahīnā tu yā nārī dūre tāṃ parivarjayet |


śrīdevī uvāca


gāyatrījapakāle tu sādhikā kiṃ japet prabho || 128 ||


śrīśiva uvāca

(śloka no. 29, 30a missing)

gāyatrīmajapāvidyāṃ prajaped yadi sādhikā |

pūrvoktena vidhānena dhyātvā kṛtvā ca pūjanam || 131 ||

mānasaṃ parameśāni japet tadgatamānasā |

tataḥ ṣaṣṭhadinaṃ prāpya prātaḥ snānaṃ samācaret || 132 ||

kuṅkumāgurupaṅkena kastūrīcandanena ca |

kūrmabījaṃ likhed bhadre athavā śvetacandanaiḥ || 133 ||

tatrāsanaṃ samāsthāya viśet sādhakasannidhau |

evaṃ vidhāya sā sādhvī sādhako'pi prasannadhīḥ || 134 ||

saṃkalpya vidhinā bhaktyā mūlamantrasya siddhaye |

lakṣaṃ japet puraścaryāvidhau vidhividhānataḥ || 135 ||

